00:44:16,875 --> 00:44:22,875
Alien Resurrection is a 1997 American science fiction horror film directed by Jean-Pierre
Jeunet, written by Joss Whedon, and starring Sigourney Weaver and Winona Ryder.

14
00:47:41,250 --> 00:47:47,250
It is the fourth installment of the Alien franchise, and was filmed at
the 20th Century Fox studios in Los Angeles, California.

15
00:51:05,625 --> 00:51:11,625
In the film, set 200 years after Alien 3 (1992), Ellen Ripley is cloned
and an Alien queen is surgically removed from her body.

16
00:54:30,000 --> 00:54:36,000
The United Systems Military (USM) hopes to breed Aliens to study and research on the spaceship USM
Auriga, using human hosts abducted and delivered to them by a group of mercenaries.

17
00:57:54,375 --> 00:58:00,375
The Aliens escape their enclosures, and Ripley and the mercenaries attempt
to escape and destroy the Auriga before it reaches Earth.

18
